The legal texts come from the Presidency of the Republic of Brazil (Casa Civil), Planalto legislation portal:

  Texto oficial: Presidência da República, Casa Civil, https://www.planalto.gov.br/ccivil_03/,
  read through Internet Archive copies of the Planalto pages (capture timestamps in tools/sources.json),
  retrieved 28 October 2026. Este texto não substitui o publicado no Diário Oficial da União.

Official acts, laws and judicial decisions are not protected by copyright in Brazil (Lei 9.610/1998, art. 8º, IV).

Changes made by Lexifina: the annotated text was converted to one Markdown file per article, one paragraph per line;
spacing, quotes, dashes and label typesetting were normalised; Planalto's amendment notes were removed from the text
and used only to date and credit each change; and the versions were arranged as git commits credited to the
amendments that made each change. The wording of the law was not changed. The Presidency does not endorse this
repository.

Lexifina's own contributions (the arrangement of the history, the commit messages, the tables and the tools) are
dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode

Further sources (since 24 November 2026):

  normas.leg.br (Congresso Nacional), https://normas.leg.br/ : every record of its API carries
  "license": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/" (read 24 November 2026, records of LC 214/2025 and
  Lei 8.078/1990). Used under CC BY 4.0: the provision versions of LC 214/2025 under
  federal/leis-complementares/lei-complementar-214-de-2025/ and the original texts under federal/textos-originais/
  come from it; each commit names the record (Source, URN) and carries Source-licence: CC-BY-4.0. Changes: HTML
  converted to plain text, one provision per line; Word conversion markers removed; no wording changed.
  Fonte: normas.leg.br (Congresso Nacional), CC BY 4.0.

  Banco Central do Brasil, normativos (https://www.bcb.gov.br/estabilidadefinanceira/buscanormas, read through its
  public API, 24 November 2026): resolutions of the Conselho Monetário Nacional and the BCB's normative acts under
  reguladores/. They are official acts (Lei 9.610/1998, art. 8º, IV); no separate terms of use were found for the
  normativos service. The authoritative text is the one published in the Diário Oficial da União.

  Planalto (https://www.planalto.gov.br/ccivil_03/) is now also read live (robots.txt: none, 24 November 2026), for
  its year indexes of federal norms and to check texts.

  Senado Federal, Dados Abertos Legislativos (SIGEN), https://legis.senado.leg.br/dadosabertos/ : public API, no
  authentication; it states that more than 10 requests a second may receive HTTP 429 (v3/api-docs, read 24 November
  2026). Used for the catalogue of federal norms (counts and dates), not for law text.

Courts (since 24 November 2026); court decisions are official acts (Lei 9.610/1998, art. 8º, IV):

  Superior Tribunal de Justiça, Portal de Dados Abertos: Íntegras de decisões terminativas e acórdãos (2008-2020 and Diário da Justiça 2021-), Espelhos de acórdãos, https://dadosabertos.web.stj.jus.br/ (read 2026-11-24): Creative Commons Atribuição (CKAN license_id "cc-by"). CKAN package_show for each dataset gives license_id "cc-by" ("Creative Commons Atribuição"). Termo de Uso (search-index text; the PDF answered 403 to us): data may be "usados, reutilizados e redistribuídos livremente, inclusive para fins comerciais", "citando a fonte". Dataset note: "Não estão disponíveis dados de processos em segredo de justiça." Court decisions are not protected by copyright: Lei 9.610/1998 art. 8º, IV. Changes made by Lexifina: one file per decision, the dataset's SEQ_DOCUMENTO/REGISTRO/ID_PECA header lines and <br> tags made plain, protected cases left out. Gap: DJe days 2019-11-05 to 2020-12-31 are in neither dataset. Used for tribunais/stj/.
  Fonte: Superior Tribunal de Justiça, Portal de Dados Abertos (dadosabertos.web.stj.jus.br), Creative Commons Atribuição.

  Supremo Tribunal Federal, pesquisa de jurisprudência (API jurisprudencia.stf.jus.br), https://jurisprudencia.stf.jus.br/ (read 2026-11-24): Official texts: not protected by copyright (Lei 9.610/1998 art. 8º, IV: "decisões judiciais e demais atos oficiais"). No terms page found for the jurisprudence search or its API (searched 2026-11-24). Informativo STF: "Permite-se a reprodução ... sem alteração do conteúdo, desde que citada a fonte". portal.stf.jus.br/processos (robots Disallow) and redir.stf.jus.br (WAF challenge) are never requested; their URLs are only cited. Used for tribunais/stf/.
  Fonte: Supremo Tribunal Federal (jurisprudencia.stf.jus.br).

  Tribunal de Justiça do Distrito Federal e dos Territórios, JurisDF (API jurisdf.tjdft.jus.br), https://jurisdf.tjdft.jus.br/ (read 2026-11-24): Official texts: not protected by copyright (Lei 9.610/1998 art. 8º, IV). No terms found. Records flagged segredoJustica are not taken. Used for tribunais/tjdft/.
  Fonte: Tribunal de Justiça do Distrito Federal e dos Territórios (jurisdf.tjdft.jus.br).

  Tribunal Superior do Trabalho, pesquisa de jurisprudência and inteiro teor (jurisprudencia.tst.jus.br, consultadocumento.tst.jus.br), https://jurisprudencia.tst.jus.br/ (read 2026-11-24): Official texts: not protected by copyright (Lei 9.610/1998 art. 8º, IV). No terms found. Full text read from the text layer of the court's own PDF for each record. Used for tribunais/tst/.
  Fonte: Tribunal Superior do Trabalho (jurisprudencia.tst.jus.br).

  RepoJus: Jurisprudência e Legislação Brasileiras de Inteiro Teor (Hugging Face andrebadini/repojus, snapshot v3), a third-party mirror, https://huggingface.co/datasets/andrebadini/repojus (read 2026-11-24): Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0), https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/. Dataset card (license: cc-by-4.0) cites Lei 9.610/1998 art. 8º, IV and says names are kept as published. Used only for courts without an official lane here (state, federal, labour, electoral and military courts); each commit cites the court's own URL (Official-Text) and carries Mirror and Source-licence trailers. Read through the Hugging Face dataset viewer API. Changes made by Lexifina: one file per decision, protected cases left out, records without full text left out. Used for tribunais/<tj*|trf*|trt*|tre-pr|stm|tjm*>/.
  "RepoJus", André Badini, Hugging Face (huggingface.co/datasets/andrebadini/repojus), CC BY 4.0.

